      "category": "Text",
      "text": "TO: HEADS OF ALL CITY DEPARTMENTS AND AGENCIES\nFROM: HONORABLE ROBERT F. WAGNER, MAYOR, CITY OF NEW YORK\nSUBJECT: SENIOR CITIZENS MONTH --- MAY, 1959",
