        "density": 0.01351,
        "chars": 354,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 44.01
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        286,
        1997,
        1658,
        2432
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The Senior Citizens Month Committee sponsors this observance and may be called upon for suggestions for participation. In order that your activities may be included in the Committee's comprehensive press releases, early notification of your plans should be made to the Committee, attention: Mr. David Laurence, 150 Nassau Street, New York 38; DIGby 4 - 8700, extension 298.",
